  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution  to TradeMark East Africa Uganda programme (Spending on Recurrent Costs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Contribution  to TradeMark East Africa Uganda programme (Spending on Recurrent Costs) is a component of Trademark East Africa - Uganda Window reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xa3;11,009,511. It works in the following sector(s): Regional trade agreements (RTAs), Trade facilitation, Trade policy and administrative management, Domestic revenue mobilisation, Trade education/training.</narrative>
  </description>
